Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:03.90,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Is Falulu here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.22,0:00:09.49,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I can't wait to hear about her time at PriPari, the capital of flowers and fashion-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:00:11.91,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I'm sure she has grown some.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.91,0:00:14.48,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,But I'm still max upset!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.48,0:00:15.87,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,That stupid Phantom Thief Genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.87,0:00:19.14,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,He made a fool of us by stealing our coord and calling our friendship fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.14,0:00:20.39,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,It is irritating-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:21.13,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.62,0:00:22.64,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:25.85,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Falulu and Unicorn are finally coming back to see us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.85,0:00:27.34,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Let's enjoy the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:33.06,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It's been so long since I've seen Unicorn-sama that I'm getting excited-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:38.33,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Anyway, when she turned into a Pegasus, she became a Legendary Mascot-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.17,0:00:42.48,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,With that, there's no way we could be rude-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.16,0:00:49.95,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,That divine light...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:53.29,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Unicorn-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.29,0:00:56.25,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It's such a dazzling light, Unicorn-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.25,0:01:11.75,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Long time no see-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.75,0:01:14.22,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Huh? You're back to normal-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.22,0:01:16.06,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,I turned back after two days-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.71,0:01:20.34,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,All right, you can also get off, Falulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.34,0:01:23.15,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Also, watch your step-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.74,0:01:30.57,Default,All,0,0,0,,Falulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.25,0:01:37.16,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Lala! Girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.96,0:01:40.27,Default,All,0,0,0,,It's been too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.27,0:01:41.54,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We finally get to see each other again!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.54,0:01:44.17,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Yeah. Everyone seems to be doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.17,0:01:45.70,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,So do you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:49.63,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Since you're back, here's my extremely happy capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.63,0:01:51.88,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,Capisce! Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.88,0:02:06.94,Default-Alt,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,Capisce! Capisce! Capisce! Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:04.83,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:41.35,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Falulu Has Returned-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:44.58,Default,Non,0,0,0,,Falulu-sama, welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.97,0:03:46.54,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,I'm back, Non-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.54,0:03:51.05,Default,Non,0,0,0,,Being able to talk with my beloved Falulu-sama again is like a dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.05,0:03:55.45,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But Non, haven't you said that you like Fuwari-chan lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.45,0:03:58.26,Default,Non,0,0,0,,I have a separate place in my heart for Falulu-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.77,0:04:01.22,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,I bought you a gift, Non-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:03.29,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,They're PriPari flower seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.29,0:04:04.30,Default,Non,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.30,0:04:05.94,Default,Non,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:07.44,Default,Non,0,0,0,,I'll grow them with care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:11.90,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,We also went out and bought stylish PriPari souvenirs for the rest of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.93,0:04:16.61,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,PriPari cookies!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.61,0:04:18.10,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,A pendant-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.10,0:04:19.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.98,0:04:21.79,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,This is pretty stylish!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:24.50,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:27.21,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Even a Go table!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.21,0:04:30.35,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Um, what about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:32.10,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Did you get anything-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:35.19,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,We got a special present for the two of you-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.19,0:04:37.26,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Hooray-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.68,0:04:38.32,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,Your generosity is much appreciated-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.32,0:04:42.93,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's a wonderful item worthy of an exceedingly handsome gentleman such as myself-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.37,0:04:45.39,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.82,0:04:47.85,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:50.93,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,It seems they're so impressed they're speechless-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.93,0:04:53.32,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,It's great that they like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.32,0:04:57.28,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It looks like the two of you are still good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.28,0:04:59.10,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Of course-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.10,0:05:02.34,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,But I am also a capable manager-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:07.38,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,We're trying to achieve her dream of being a Divine Idol, so there are still times when I have to scold her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.38,0:05:09.00,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Falulu understands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:11.71,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come on, Falulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.71,0:05:14.49,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,{\i1}Redo that move-dechu!{lit- dance, but probably not the whole thing, but the part she screwed up}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.49,0:05:17.20,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, that wasn't harsh enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.20,0:05:19.06,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to be stricter!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.06,0:05:20.25,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,{\i1}Me-me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.68,0:05:25.33,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Unicorn has been secretly practising scolding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.17,0:05:25.33,Default-Alt,Unicorn,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.33,0:05:28.48,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Don't tell them that-dechu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.77,0:05:32.61,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,More importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.61,0:05:36.57,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Unicorn's tail is spiral poop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.57,0:05:40.27,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Unicorn's tail is spiral poop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.27,0:05:43.57,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,Spiral poop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:45.07,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.07,0:05:47.95,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,If you don't shut your traps I'll get angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:53.96,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Um, now that we're on the topic,\Njust what are these little things-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:58.28,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,These Mini Falulu are all the same as Falulu-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.28,0:05:59.55,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Wait, that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.09,0:06:02.26,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,The PriTickets that don't have owners...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.73,0:06:04.28,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.82,0:06:11.40,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,I now have the job of visiting the different PriParas and collecting dropped PriTickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.90,0:06:12.98,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.82,0:06:20.61,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,These girls are born from the feelings of girls who wanted to become idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.43,0:06:47.03,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,They are awoken as Vocal Dolls just like Falulu-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.66,0:06:50.10,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Falulu also helps me with it-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.10,0:06:50.88,Default,MiniFalulu1,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Falu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.88,0:06:51.27,Default,MiniFalulu2,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Falu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.27,0:06:53.44,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Falulu-oneechan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.44,0:06:55.69,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Falulu-oneechan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:58.89,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,So they're all Falulu's little sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.89,0:07:00.53,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,They're all so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.53,0:07:02.66,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,But aren't there a bit too many-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.66,0:07:04.28,Default,MiniFalulu3,0,0,0,,What's "-pri"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:04.73,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.73,0:07:05.84,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.84,0:07:09.44,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,"-pri" is... uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.44,0:07:10.87,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,A sentence ender-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.87,0:07:12.34,Default,MiniFalulu4,0,0,0,,What's a sentence ender?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.34,0:07:14.08,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,What is it? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:18.18,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Sentence enders such as "-pri" and "-chanko" are used at the end of a sentence...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.18,0:07:21.29,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,...to bring across a type of character or atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.29,0:07:23.14,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,What's "atmosphere"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.14,0:07:27.26,Default-Alt,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,What is it? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.55,0:07:27.26,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,"Atmosphere" is... "Atmosphere" is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.26,0:07:29.32,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What you roll rice balls in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:30.98,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Wrong-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:36.25,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,If you use "-pri", you can become a pop idol like Mirelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:38.51,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Now then, everyone practise it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.51,0:07:39.41,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,And start!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.41,0:07:42.63,Default,MiniFalulu,0,0,0,,Pri! Pri! Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.63,0:07:43.74,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.74,0:07:44.84,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,And start!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:47.92,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,Pri! Pri! Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:49.59,Default,MiniFalulu5,0,0,0,,I've memorised "-pri"-pri
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.59,0:07:50.90,Default,MiniFalulu6,0,0,0,,I've memorised it-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:52.96,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Good job, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:54.20,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:55.92,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,They really learned it-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.92,0:07:59.67,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Those playing with Falulu gather around the horn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.88,0:08:03.84,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:06.80,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Cease-dechu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:09.76,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Hey, that's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:11.17,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,No, not there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:14.98,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Falulu really is acting like a proper older sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:17.36,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Falulu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.27,0:08:19.55,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.55,0:08:21.33,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Oh, whoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:22.27,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:25.91,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,I need to attend a PriTicket snapping event for my fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.91,0:08:27.91,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.33,0:08:30.54,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,We can play more when I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:32.97,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Please look after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.97,0:08:34.07,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.12,0:08:39.60,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Now then, those playing with Unicorn gather round the horn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.11,0:08:45.30,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Dechu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.30,0:08:48.38,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Hey, don't just go wherever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:50.70,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing, you brats?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.70,0:08:51.76,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:53.17,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,They're in groups!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:54.55,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,They're doing whatever they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.55,0:08:56.31,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Let's split up and catch them-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.31,0:08:57.73,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.23,0:09:02.94,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mini Falulu-chans, where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.28,0:09:04.58,Default,Fan1,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Lala-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.58,0:09:06.55,Default,Fan2,0,0,0,,Lala-chan, give me your autograph!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.55,0:09:08.72,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,C-Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.55,0:09:08.06,Default-Alt,Fan3,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Your autograph!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.06,0:09:08.72,Default-Alt,Fan4,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Your autograph!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:10.16,Default-Alt,MiniFalulu1,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Your autograph!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:14.62,Default-Alt,MiniFalulu1,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Autograph it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.21,0:09:19.44,Default,MiniFalulu2,0,0,0,,Maalulu memorized her autograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:20.80,Default,MiniFalulu3,0,0,0,,Naaruru also memorized it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.80,0:09:21.79,Default,MiniFalulu4,0,0,0,,Hyaruru too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.79,0:09:23.17,Default,MiniFalulu5,0,0,0,,Charuru too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:34.81,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,They're pretty good...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.36,0:09:39.02,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,According to Mirelle's calculations, they should be here-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.02,0:09:41.52,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Dressing rooms are over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.29,0:09:46.36,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Found them-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.14,0:09:46.36,Default-Alt,MiniFalulu,0,0,0,,My, oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.90,0:09:47.72,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.72,0:09:49.73,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Chanko-chan, that's really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.73,0:09:51.07,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.07,0:09:52.79,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Thank you-chanko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.79,0:09:55.54,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Now give us an even more daring, sexy pose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:09:57.04,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Shy-chanko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:09:58.54,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,But now Chanko...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.62,0:10:01.42,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,...has climbed the stairs of adulthood-chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:02.25,Default,MiniFalulu,0,0,0,,Chalu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:05.96,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Hey, get out of the way-chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:07.45,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,A swarm has been found!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.45,0:10:08.42,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Prepare yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.02,0:10:13.18,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:18.69,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,As expected, Chanko will be eternally innocent-chanko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:26.57,Default,Gondolier,0,0,0,,O Sole, O Sole Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.46,0:10:26.57,Default-Alt,MiniFalulu,0,0,0,,Malu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.57,0:10:27.27,Default,MiniFalulu,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Maalu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:27.79,Default,MiniFalulu,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Faalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:28.26,Default,MiniFalulu,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Chalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.79,0:10:31.79,Default,Gondolier,0,0,0,,Canzone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.13,0:10:33.32,Default,Doona,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.18,0:10:37.58,Default,MiniFalulu1,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Falu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.58,0:10:38.72,Default,MiniFalulu2,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Falu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:39.50,Default,MiniFalulu3,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Falu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:40.15,Default,MiniFalulu4,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Falu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.15,0:10:41.25,Default,MiniFalulu5,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Falu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.25,0:10:42.71,Default,Gondolier,0,0,0,,Pianissimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.67,0:10:49.67,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Glo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.67,0:10:52.37,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Glo! Glo! Glo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.37,0:10:54.14,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Oh, it's tuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:55.81,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.81,0:10:57.56,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'll take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.94,0:11:01.81,Default,Fan1,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to meet you, Falulu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:03.27,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.93,0:11:08.97,Default,Fan2,0,0,0,,I'm still rooting for you even though you went to PriPari.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.97,0:11:09.78,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.51,0:11:13.24,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Falulu wonders if they're staying put and behaving themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.24,0:11:15.73,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Wait! Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:16.67,Default-Alt,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Hold it-dechu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.73,0:11:17.66,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.66,0:11:19.46,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:21.66,Default,PinkActress,0,0,0,,We're Pink Actress!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:23.62,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.20,0:11:25.71,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,All right, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:27.13,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Music...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.13,0:11:28.88,Default-Alt,MomoSakura,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.13,0:11:28.88,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:31.01,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.28,0:11:34.93,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.21,0:11:34.93,Default-Alt,PinkAcress,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.93,0:11:36.68,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.03,0:11:39.98,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Hey, you, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.03,0:11:39.98,Default-Alt,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You're not getting away-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.28,0:11:52.33,Default,MiniFalulu1,0,0,0,,Falu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.33,0:11:52.78,Default,MiniFalulu2,0,0,0,,Woohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.78,0:11:53.30,Default,MiniFalulu3,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:54.24,Default,MiniFalulu4,0,0,0,,Wee!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.24,0:11:57.20,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You're not getting away-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.24,0:11:57.20,Default-Alt,Lala,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.79,0:12:00.16,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,W-What's with those little girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.12,0:12:03.12,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,They broke the stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.60,0:12:05.85,Default,MiniFalulu345,0,0,0,,Maaruru memorized kyupikon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.85,0:12:07.02,Default,MiniFalulu563,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.02,0:12:08.59,Default,MiniFalulu,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.59,0:12:10.86,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,W-What do we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:12.73,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,We can't perform like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.73,0:12:14.20,Default,Sakura,0,0,0,,Now that it's come to this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.45,0:12:16.81,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.81,0:12:18.10,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.10,0:12:19.30,Default,PinkActress,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.30,0:12:20.56,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.56,0:12:21.87,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.87,0:12:23.02,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.02,0:12:25.60,Default-Alt,All,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kyupikon! Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.60,0:12:28.07,Default-Alt,All,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kyupikon! Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.07,0:12:30.60,Default-Alt,All,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kyupikon! Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.60,0:12:32.24,Default-Alt,All,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.24,0:12:34.37,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Girls, calm down-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.91,0:12:37.15,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Those brats are at tension max!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:38.12,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.59,0:12:39.77,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Unprecedented!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.77,0:12:41.08,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,This is absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:44.02,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,This has become a terrible situation-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.02,0:12:48.25,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,I'll take responsibility and snap off my horn-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:49.21,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.17,0:12:51.36,Default-Alt,MiniFalulu,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.36,0:12:52.57,Default-Alt,MiniFalulu,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.57,0:12:54.06,Default-Alt,MiniFalulu,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.54,0:12:55.38,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:08.56,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:10.31,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.61,0:13:11.27,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.36,0:13:16.53,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Falulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.18,0:13:18.64,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,We're in trouble-dechu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.64,0:13:20.69,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,No one was in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.69,0:13:22.70,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Falulu's been looking all over for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.70,0:13:26.00,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,As you can see, they're causing trouble for everyone-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.00,0:13:28.57,Default-Alt,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Hey! Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.57,0:13:30.75,Default-Alt,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:30.75,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like any of them have noticed you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.75,0:13:32.95,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I just came up with a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.95,0:13:33.77,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.47,0:13:41.68,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Those who want to see Falulu's concert, gather around the horn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.68,0:13:42.89,Default,MiniFalulu,0,0,0,,Falu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:48.01,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.74,0:14:01.65,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'd also like to see you perform since it's been so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.65,0:14:03.12,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.12,0:14:05.37,Default,PinkActress,0,0,0,,Us too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.37,0:14:06.29,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.29,0:14:09.00,Default,Fan1,0,0,0,,You can do it, Falulu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.26,0:14:12.21,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.21,0:14:14.67,Default,Fans,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:20.13,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,We'll show you how much brighter she's become since PriPari-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.67,0:14:31.73,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:33.84,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.44,0:14:38.81,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,A mauve arrangement full of high-end cloth as pure white as an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.81,0:14:42.37,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Mauve is what one in France would call purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.37,0:14:44.45,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Angelic Mauve Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.45,0:14:45.33,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Falu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.23,0:14:54.00,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,It's been a while, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:55.71,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,I've wanted to see you all again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.05,0:14:57.85,Default,Fan2,0,0,0,,Falulu-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.85,0:14:59.72,Default,Fan3,0,0,0,,We've been waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.72,0:15:01.21,Default,MiniFalulu2,0,0,0,,Falulu-oneechan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.21,0:15:02.68,Default,MiniFalulu3,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.27,0:16:37.60,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.54,0:16:52.18,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Hop!{x5}{consistency with Naisho}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.18,0:16:52.79,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Hop!{x5}{consistency with Naisho}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.79,0:16:53.55,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Hop!{x5}{consistency with Naisho}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.55,0:16:54.23,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Hop!{x5}{consistency with Naisho}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.23,0:16:55.21,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Hop!{x5}{consistency with Naisho}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:02.28,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,For all of you!{consistency with Naisho}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.88,0:17:05.98,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Tick Tock Flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:10.86,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.39,0:17:17.85,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Falu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:03.61,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:08.70,Default-Alt,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Falulu-chan received pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.70,0:18:10.09,Default-Alt,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.09,0:18:13.53,Default-Alt,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Are the wings gold because it's from PriPari?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:15.81,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,She's ranked up from Major Class's Popular Idol to...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.81,0:18:18.48,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,...Widely Famous Idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.48,0:18:22.50,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Falulu-chan started in the Understudy Class at PriPari.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.50,0:18:29.26,Default,MiniFalulu1,0,0,0,,Maalulu wants to be an idol just like Falulu-oneechan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.26,0:18:30.57,Default,MiniFalulu2,0,0,0,,So does Naaruru!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.57,0:18:31.38,Default,MiniFalulu3,0,0,0,,Pyaruru too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:32.22,Default,MiniFalulu4,0,0,0,,Charuru too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.52,0:18:35.68,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,We love Falulu-oneechan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:38.23,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Falulu loves all of you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.23,0:18:40.56,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,So even they can be cute when they're like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.14,0:18:44.02,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Even though they just caused so much chaos,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:47.61,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,they're growing up fast and are desperate to perform concerts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.14,0:18:50.68,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Falulu's concert really was something-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.68,0:18:55.15,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You've improved so much since you've been at PriPari.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.15,0:18:55.93,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.93,0:18:58.96,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We'll work even harder now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.96,0:18:59.58,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.96,0:18:59.58,Default-Alt,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:00.71,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Same!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.38,0:19:02.32,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:04.67,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Why's that one all by herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.04,0:19:06.35,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.78,0:19:09.85,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.85,0:19:11.13,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.13,0:19:11.51,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.51,0:19:14.85,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Isn't that Falulu's Non?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.72,0:19:16.68,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.68,0:19:18.89,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.99,0:19:21.69,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,She bit ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.69,0:19:22.59,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.59,0:19:24.52,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.65,0:19:26.48,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Dorthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:28.11,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,It's pointless-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.67,0:19:35.57,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Falulu and the other girls were all born when feelings of becoming idols came together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.31,0:19:38.83,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,But Gaalulu is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.13,0:19:39.91,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:43.55,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Even though girls normally strive to be sparkling idols,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.55,0:19:46.67,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,it doesn't always go that way-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.67,0:19:48.95,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.95,0:19:50.82,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,{\i1}I cannot dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.82,0:19:53.70,Default,Rand3,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't want to do or see any more concerts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.70,0:19:56.43,Default,Rand4,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe it's impossible for me to be an idol...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.40,0:19:59.92,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,They couldn't become what they wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:04.10,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Those girls' gloomy feelings gathered together...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:17.29,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,And that's how Gaalulu was born-dechu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.12,0:20:20.08,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.74,0:20:23.59,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,She said she hates idols...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.59,0:20:26.04,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Sophie, you can understand her-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:27.75,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.59,0:20:31.17,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,She said she wants to be a monster...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:35.26,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Gaalulu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.48,0:20:41.31,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,It went by so quickly, but you really helped us-dechu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.61,0:20:43.25,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:45.50,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Did all of you learn a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.50,0:20:46.52,Default,MiniFalulu,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.93,0:20:49.23,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,All right, now start!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.23,0:20:51.20,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Capisce-pri-kyupikon!{in the CCs it has it as 1 mashed together word}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.20,0:20:53.19,Default,MiniFalulus,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Capisce-pri-kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.19,0:20:54.63,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.63,0:20:56.15,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,That's all...?{in the end, that's...}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.15,0:20:58.85,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,All right, get on up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.85,0:20:59.73,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Maaruru,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.73,0:21:00.62,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Naaruru,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.62,0:21:01.52,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Charuru,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.52,0:21:02.66,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Pyaruru...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.66,0:21:05.13,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,They could have stayed longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.13,0:21:08.52,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Unicorn has her own work to attend to, so there's no helping it-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.52,0:21:10.59,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But we'll see each other soon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.59,0:21:12.73,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,99...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.73,0:21:13.76,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.76,0:21:15.05,Default,Unicorn,0,0,0,,We're missing one-dechu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.05,0:21:16.47,Default,All,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.81,0:21:19.68,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Our flight bound for PriPari will be taking off shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.68,0:21:21.89,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.27,0:21:23.13,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.13,0:21:24.35,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu's not onboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.64,0:21:26.81,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Eh?! Gaalulu's not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.81,0:23:07.22,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Gaalulu ran away?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.22,0:23:07.99,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.99,0:23:11.08,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I wonder if there's something she doesn't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.08,0:23:13.92,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,She's bitten a lot of people!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.92,0:23:15.70,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,We have to find her quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.70,0:23:17.13,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I may not have much energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.13,0:23:18.42,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,but I'll do everything I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.42,0:23:19.71,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.66,0:23:23.26,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Gaalulu's in the system control room!?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.26,0:23:24.45,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.45,0:23:25.76,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,We're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.76,0:23:27.38,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Wait for us, Gaalulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.81,0:23:28.82,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.82,0:23:30.21,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It's Sunny Once In A While.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.21,0:23:31.65,Default,Gaalulu,0,0,0,,Gaalulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.65,0:23:33.01,Default,All,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.01,0:23:34.60,Default,All,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!

